    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 8fc5d03448da44a4b9ef200196a5b549
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A swarmling (rat, larva, nanite mite — any faction): tiny, fast and fragile, always in numbers. Pounces the instant its target turns or reloads, nips in for a bite and darts back out, jinks away from incoming fire.'
